Branch: testing/rc
Commit: 90b0844 base (plus the WiVRn changes and bug fixes below).
The SteamVR repo has since moved to a377535 (driver-log rotation); not synced.

This directory is a self-contained copy so the WiVRn port does not clone or
depend on the SteamVR port at install time. WiVRn-specific edits live here:

  templates/launch_serverhelper.sh.in
    - warm_wineserver() (persistent prefix server, serialised socket)
    - PSVR2 reg import via $PROTON_WINE (not `proton run`)
    - STANDABLE_GUI=1: spawn Standable.exe into the driver wineserver,
      cwd at the game root, Steam identity env

Bug fixes carried here (also worth backporting to the SteamVR port):
    - gen(): escape & and | in Steam paths before sed
    - standable_launch_hook.sh.in: cd to the game root before Standable.exe
    - install.sh --uninstall: restore originals from .bak instead of deleting
      them; only remove our VRChat LocalLow symlink
    - same-file guard for steam_api64.dll in bin/win64

When pulling fixes from the SteamVR port, diff against that repo and keep
these changes.
